  "description": "Atomic clinical indicators for the X-ray Chest (Adult) national referral criteria (National Community Referral Criteria for Imaging Part I, v2.0, published 09/04/2026, pp.62-65). NOT CLINICALLY REVIEWED (staging demo, AD-35). The LLM extraction step, structured referral forms and the Criteria Viewer all produce a QuestionnaireResponse against this Questionnaire, which the CQL library CRR_XRChest_Adult evaluates. Each answer may carry the answer-evidence extension (status documented|inferred, quote). No item is populated from the patient record (no population library). The national red-flag stem redflag.haemoptysisPresent is shared with the national Questionnaire and answered once.",
